    "title": "Jimmy 'Jim' Mack Elliot - NewsBreak",
    "text": "12 days ago Jimmy “Jim” Mack Elliott, a resident of Henryetta, passed away on October 1, 2025, at the age of 83. He was born August 28, 1942, in Cheatham County, Tenn., to Hugo and Margaret (Stubblefield) Elliott. Jim worked for himself as a building contractor and was a veteran serving in the U.S. Army. He married Norma Dickens on December 4, 1973. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
